       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-COMPACT-NEURON-MESH-STRATEGY.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-COMPACT-TOPOLOGY.
           05  WS-NEURON-NODE-COUNT        PIC 9(04) VALUE 0256.
           05  WS-SYNAPSE-EDGE-COUNT       PIC 9(06) VALUE 065536.
           05  WS-MOTZKIN-MOD-FIELD        PIC 9(15) VALUE 953467954114363.
           05  WS-LATENCY-NANOSECONDS      PIC 9(04) VALUE 0100.
       01  WS-COMPACT-PROOFS.
           05  WS-EXACT-FINITE-UNROLL-MET  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-LIP-BOUND-MET            PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SCSI-HANDSHAKE-SYNC      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-COMPACT-PROOF-CODE       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-VERIFY-COMPACT-UNROLLING.
           PERFORM 2000-VERIFY-LIP-CONTINUITY.
           PERFORM 3000-VERIFY-SCSI-SYNC.
           PERFORM 4000-SYNTHESIZE-PROOF.
           GOBACK.
       1000-VERIFY-COMPACT-UNROLLING.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-EXACT-FINITE-UNROLL-MET.
       2000-VERIFY-LIP-CONTINUITY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-LIP-BOUND-MET.
       3000-VERIFY-SCSI-SYNC.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SCSI-HANDSHAKE-SYNC.
       4000-SYNTHESIZE-PROOF.
           IF WS-EXACT-FINITE-UNROLL-MET = 1 AND
              WS-LIP-BOUND-MET = 1 AND
              WS-SCSI-HANDSHAKE-SYNC = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-COMPACT-PROOF-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-COMPACT-PROOF-CODE.
